  // scripts/remote-mdns.ts
  "[remote-mdns] sem HABBLAUD_REMOTE_NAME v\xE1lido no .env: rode npm run remote:setup.": "[remote-mdns] sin HABBLAUD_REMOTE_NAME v\xE1lido en el .env: ejecuta npm run remote:setup.",
